        <mxCell id="planner-detail" value="Job: Understand user intent&#xa;&#xa;Layer 1: Regex patterns (fast)&#xa;  &quot;add field X&quot; → add_column&#xa;  &quot;delete X&quot;    → delete_employee&#xa;  &quot;update X Y&quot;  → update_employee&#xa;&#xa;Layer 2: Gemini AI (complex)&#xa;  Sends prompt → gets JSON&#xa;&#xa;Layer 3: Fallback regex" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;fontColor=#333;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
